  'server.loadFailed': ['资源加载失败，请刷新页面或检查服务器。', 'Resources could not load. Refresh the page or check the server.'],
  'help.eyebrow': ['雪原笔记', 'FIELD NOTES'],
  'help.title': ['雪原生存手册', 'Snowfield survival guide'],
  'help.close': ['关闭操作指南', 'Close field guide'],
  'help.movementTitle': ['走进雪原', 'Into the snow'],
  'help.movement': ['<kbd>WASD</kbd> 移动，全速每秒 4 格，普通小怪和大怪每秒 1.2 格，紫色快速怪每秒 4.8 格。数字 <kbd>1–0</kbd> 或滚轮选择物品栏。<kbd>Q</kbd> 朝鼠标方向最多丢出 2 格，受阻时取障碍前最远可用落点；0.75 米内且背包未满才自动拾取。', '<kbd>WASD</kbd> to move at up to 4 tiles/s; regular small and big monsters move at 1.2 tiles/s, purple fast monsters at 4.8 tiles/s. Use <kbd>1–0</kbd> or scroll to select a hotbar slot. <kbd>Q</kbd> drops toward the cursor up to 2 tiles, stopping at the farthest reachable point before an obstacle. Auto-pickup needs a free backpack slot and a distance of at most 0.75 m.'],
  'help.buildingTitle': ['收集与建造', 'Gather and build'],
  'help.building': ['选斧头或电锯，长按左键砍树或拆墙。箱子、篝火和三种机器先打开窗口，再长按窗内拆除按钮 1.5 秒；箱子与篝火须取空，松开即取消；回收的篝火为熄灭状态。自助火柴机提供 10 木材与 1 金币互换、1 金币换 1 盒火柴。<kbd>B</kbd> 打开背包与合成，选中建筑后单击左键放置。可放置到 3 格内的合法空格，中间的方块不阻挡放置。箱子、篝火、小猪存钱罐和三种交易机器之间必须空出一格，斜对角也不能紧邻。', 'Equip an axe or chainsaw or chainsaw and hold left click to chop trees or dismantle walls. Open a chest, campfire or trading machine, then hold its panel button for 1.5 s. Chests and campfires must be empty; recovered campfires are unlit. Release to cancel. Match dispensers exchange 10 wood for 1 coin and vice versa, or 1 coin for 1 matchbox. <kbd>B</kbd> opens backpack & crafting. Select a building item and left click to place it on a valid empty tile within 3 tiles; intervening blocks do not prevent placement. Chests, campfires, piggy banks and all three trading machines must not touch each other, even diagonally.'],
  'help.fireTitle': ['点一堆火', 'Keep a fire'],
  'help.fire': ['加入木材和火种后点燃。一份木材烧 120 秒。露天贴着火主要止住失温；关门封闭屋子后能缓慢回暖，地板覆盖越多回温越快。环境温度计会显示房间、地板覆盖率和热源距离。', 'Add wood and an igniter. One wood burns for 120 seconds. An outdoor fire mainly stops heat loss; a closed room warms you slowly, and floor coverage speeds recovery. Check the local thermometer for enclosure, floor coverage and distance to the fire.'],
  'help.foodTitle': ['好好吃饭', 'Eat well'],
  'help.food': ['选中食品，对空地长按 0.5 秒。即食可以直接吃，需火食品要在点燃篝火 1～3 格内。饱食度最多 10，自然每分钟消耗 0.6。受击扣除相当于体温伤害四分之一的饱食度，单次最多 1 点。', 'Select food and hold over empty ground for 0.5s. Ready-to-eat food needs no fire; cook within one to three tiles of a lit fire. Satiety is capped at 10 and drains by 0.6 per minute. Hits cost a quarter of the temperature damage in satiety, capped at one per hit.'],
  'help.storageTitle': ['背包与容器', 'Bags and containers'],
  'help.storage': ['<kbd>B</kbd> 同时打开30格背包和合成；下方10格物品栏独立存储。点击随身物品查看侧边说明，空格隐藏说明；双击或点说明卡按钮转移到另一区域，也可拖动。<kbd>Shift</kbd>点击随身物品存入已打开容器，否则在物品栏与背包之间转移。手机也可用整理模式指定格子。', '<kbd>B</kbd> opens the separate 30-slot backpack and crafting beside the 10-slot hotbar. Click carried items to inspect their side guide; empty slots hide it. Double-click or use the guide button to transfer, or drag. <kbd>Shift</kbd>-click stores items in an open container, or transfers between personal areas. Mobile Arrange mode also selects destination slots.'],
  'help.combatTitle': ['留心身后', 'Watch your back'],
  'help.monsters': ['大怪和快速怪在 06:00～18:00 休眠，其他游荡怪照常活动。短距离可以用近战击退，遇到大怪远程攻击时利用墙和闭门挡弹。', 'Big and fast monsters rest from 06:00 to 18:00. Other roaming monsters remain active. Melee knockback buys room up close, and walls and closed doors block big monster shots.'],
  'help.combat': ['手枪与霰弹枪单击，步枪可长按连发。按 R 或点“装填”补入兼容弹药，换枪或受击会打断。普通子弹碰到墙、闭门、树或第一个目标时停止，栅栏透弹。固定机枪可穿过多只怪物并逐步拆掩体。斧头和其他近战武器单击向前挥击，可命中扇形内多只怪物，空挥不扣耐久。用斧头或电锯采集时需要长按。投掷物通常长按瞄准，喷火器可按住沿瞄准方向喷射。手持提灯才能照亮迷雾。', 'Click to fire handguns and shotguns, or hold for rifles. Press R or tap Reload to load compatible ammo. Switching weapons or taking a hit interrupts reloads. Ordinary bullets stop at walls, closed doors, trees, or the first target. Fences let bullets through. Mounted guns pierce monsters and can gradually destroy cover. Click to sweep with a melee weapon. A swing can hit multiple monsters, and a miss costs no durability. Hold an axe or chainsaw to harvest. Hold and aim most throwables, or hold to spray with the flamethrower. Equip the lantern to light nearby fog.'],
  'help.bottom': ['这不是暂停菜单，在线时世界仍在运行。右上角“玩家”可展开在线与离线名单，也可切换语言与音效；只有当前前台窗口播放声音。<kbd>Esc</kbd> 返回雪原。', 'This menu does not pause the world. Open Players at the top right to see online and offline travelers, or switch language and sound. Only the focused window plays audio. <kbd>Esc</kbd> returns to the snow.'],
