  'panel.inventoryTitle': ['随身背包与合成', 'Backpack & crafting'],
  'panel.inventoryDescription': ['点击物品查看作用和用法；双击、拖动或点说明卡按钮，在独立的30格背包与10格物品栏之间转移。', 'Select an item to see its effect and use. Double-click, drag or use its guide button to transfer between the separate 30-slot backpack and 10-slot hotbar.'],
  'panel.containerDescription': ['一键搜刮时，材料、弹药和火种直接进背包，其他物品先填快捷栏。Shift 点击随身物品快速存入。', 'Take all sends materials, ammo and igniters to the backpack. Other items fill the hotbar first. Shift-click carried items to store them.'],
  'panel.chestSlots': ['{count} / {capacity} 格 · 部分材料可堆叠', '{count} / {capacity} slots · Some materials stack'],
